From f891a019b9925c61a3284b5a4e5efd946855ba8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@lmepisowifi.local>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 00:12:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Add WiFi Rates expiry/validity buckets (uptime-based
 deadline)

Same feature as tmwim2-2050-g40's commit of the same name, rebuilt on
top of this branch's now-extended sync (through the export/import
rates feature and the coin-expired race fix). See that commit's
message for the full design writeup and the parseRatesText() regex fix
needed to keep rates Import working once a third (validity) field
exists. Identical to M2's commit here except:

  - Every file's license-header repo URL points at tmwipgn6401v, not
    tmwim2-2050-g40
  - www2/cgi-bin/hotspot.cgi's ifaces_get carve-out (eth0.2.0-eth0.5.0,
    4 ethernet ports) was preserved as-is, reconfirmed against the new
    baseline the same way as the first time - none of this feature's
    edits touch that whitelist

No wlan-limit or ipacl involvement either way - this feature is purely
about COIN_RATES/session time bookkeeping, unrelated to either excluded
page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
